{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.18.115.13","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81099,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c13b471b1ef933c141900a849b42eae","RawContent":"I&#039;m looking for a really good videographer and photographer for our April Wedding. Can someone suggest who they have used or are using and why they feel they are good? Thank you? \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1918000,"PostDate":1501591879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm looking for a really good videographer and photographer for our April Wedding. Can someone suggest who they have used or are using and why they feel they are good? Thank you? <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msajecki55@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.230.20.27","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1496803235,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mohito3869","Id":288976,"Name":"Mohito3869","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.155.219.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81099,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0ff52fcb23dbde186f1e31f7456d5b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Mohito3869,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We can offer our services four your upcoming wedding, take a look www.mikecantarellfilms.com. we can offer you a discount.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;https:\/\/vimeo.com\/234730840&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918213,"PostDate":1507641395,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Mohito3869,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We can offer our services four your upcoming wedding, take a look www.mikecantarellfilms.com. we can offer you a discount.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/234730840\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mike@cancunweddingvideo.com","IpAddress":"189.149.44.30","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1198776664,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208060.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mikecantarell","Id":208060,"Name":"Mikecantarell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.157.139.170","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81099,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1203720e1e75f57fe5f70da55d370c5f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello! Im a wedding photographer, you can see my job and the packages here&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/santamariaphotogra.wixsite.com\/santamariaphoto\/book-online&#039;&gt;http:\/\/santamariaphotogra.wixsite.com\/santamariaphoto\/book-online&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And if you book in November for 2018 you can get 40% discount!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/santamariaphotographer\/photos\/a.389220101249707.1073741832.388451594659891\/872931502878562\/?type=3&amp;amp;sales_promo_bypass_snowlift=1&amp;amp;sales_promo_id=10155588544620813&amp;amp;sales_promo_referrer&amp;amp;notif_id=1510781144498435&amp;amp;notif_t=like&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/santamariaphotographer\/photos\/a.389220101249707.1073741832.388451594659891\/872931502878562\/?type=3&amp;amp;sales_promo_bypass_snowlift=1&amp;amp;sales_promo_id=10155588544620813&amp;amp;sales_promo_referrer&amp;amp;notif_id=1510781144498435&amp;amp;notif_t=like&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918295,"PostDate":1510768045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello! Im a wedding photographer, you can see my job and the packages here<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/santamariaphotogra.wixsite.com\/santamariaphoto\/book-online' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/santamariapho...oto\/book-online<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And if you book in November for 2018 you can get 40% discount!<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/santamariaphotographer\/photos\/a.389220101249707.1073741832.388451594659891\/872931502878562\/?type=3&sales_promo_bypass_snowlift=1&sales_promo_id=10155588544620813&sales_promo_referrer&notif_id=1510781144498435&notif_t=like' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...35&notif_t=like<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>Santamaria Photography<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/santamariaphotogra.wixsite.com\/santamariaphoto'>http:\/\/santamariaphotogra.wixsite.com\/santamariaphoto<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1918387]' id='ipb-attach-url-36911-0-53323600-1519957049' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2018\/post-289520-0-25324600-1515295349.jpg\" title=\"logo.jpg -  103.31KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2018\/post-289520-0-25324600-1515295349_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-36911-0-53323600-1519957049' style='width:150;height:96' class='attach' width=\"150\" height=\"96\" alt=\"logo.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"santamariaphotographer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.157.139.170","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1510767653,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-289520.jpg?_r=1510782516","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"santamariaphotographer","Id":289520,"Name":"santamariaphotographer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.18.216.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":81099,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dca7f4bd9691f2a01325cfee9865214b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mohito3869\"] I am also still searching for my wedding photographer however have been emailing back and forth with Cecilia Dumas. I found her prices to be quite reasonable and also really like her work. Her prices are quite good if one of her associate photographers are taking the pics (she still edits them) - Ballpark I think it was around $1600 - $1700 USD for 7 hours. If you want her to photograph your wedding the prices are a bit higher.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you been able to find a photographer that you liked and thought was reasonable? I am still deciding myself&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918510,"PostDate":1519914996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"288976\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/288976-mohito3869\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mohito3869<\/span><\/a> I am also still searching for my wedding photographer however have been emailing back and forth with Cecilia Dumas. I found her prices to be quite reasonable and also really like her work. Her prices are quite good if one of her associate photographers are taking the pics (she still edits them) - Ballpark I think it was around $1600 - $1700 USD for 7 hours. If you want her to photograph your wedding the prices are a bit higher.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you been able to find a photographer that you liked and thought was reasonable? I am still deciding myself\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessicacv@outlook.com","IpAddress":"159.18.216.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1500989166,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jessicacv","Id":289171,"Name":"jessicacv","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
